# Landing bootstrap (first hour)

Use on **every new brand / route** before deep section UI. Saves rework.

## 0. Fill once

- [ ] `.cursor/rules/project.mdc` + `naturavive-brand.mdc` (name, domain, colours, asset root)
- [ ] `src/config/site.ts` + `src/config/brand.ts` paths
- [ ] `src/data/<page>.ts` copy (no em/en dashes)

## 1. Next config (must)

In `next.config.ts`:

```ts
images: {
  formats: ["image/avif", "image/webp"],
  qualities: [60, 65, 75], // include every quality={N} used in Image
  // deviceSizes / imageSizes as needed
}
poweredByHeader: false
compress: true
experimental: { optimizePackageImports: ["lucide-react", "motion", "swiper"] }
```

Restart `npm run dev` after config changes.

## 2. Shell files (must)

| Piece | Rule |
|-------|------|
| Thin `page.tsx` | Compose only |
| Header | `header-nav.mdc` |
| Footer | `footer-anatomy.mdc` if CTA band exists |
| 404 | `error-page.mdc` |
| Scroll chrome | `scroll-chrome.mdc` (`scrollY > ~64`) |
| Favicon | `favicon-brand.mdc` (**transparent** pad) |
| SEO | `seo.mdc` |
| Fast load | `fast-loading.mdc` (dynamic below-fold) |

## 3. Build loop

1. Skim `landing-known-issues.mdc`
2. `/think` section-by-section
3. Gate each section: `section-build-gate.mdc`
4. `/exper` when claiming whole landing done

